
Creating your app: Pi Global Gateway 

Great news! Your Pi payment gateway app is now ready. It has a sleek, modern look with a dark theme and a pop of Pi purple that makes it feel both professional and stylish.

Here's what you can do with your new app:

*   **Home Screen:** See your balance in real-time, converted into several major currencies. You'll also find quick buttons to send or receive money, swap currencies, or scan a QR code. Your recent transactions are listed right there, and you can search through them easily.
*   **Send & Receive Money:** Sending money is a simple two-step process, and you can quickly select from people you've sent to before. To receive money, just show your unique QR code or copy your address to share.
*   **Exchange Tab:** Instantly convert between different currencies and see a full table of the latest exchange rates.
*   **Global Tab:** Check the status of the payment network around the world and see the security badges that keep your transactions safe.
*   **Settings:** Customize your app by choosing from 47 languages and adjusting your security and notification preferences.

Everything is neatly organized in a menu at the bottom of the screen, making it super easy to navigate. Your app is not only powerful but also a breeze to use!

